      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 108,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 108,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1749600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "InMemoryRunner  ·  model: gemini-2.5-flash  ·  @google/adk\n\nFunctionTools (local — bound per session):\n• extract_property_filters  →  returns FilterState to UI\n• get_free_slots  →  Google Calendar freebusy query\n• create_viewing_event  →  Google Calendar insert\n\nMCPToolset (Streamable HTTP → Kibana):\n• platform.core.generate_esql\n• platform.core.execute_esql\n• platform.core.get_index_mapping\n• platform.core.search\n• platform.core.get_document",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "InMemoryRunner  ·  model: gemini-2.5-flash  ·  @google/adk\n\nFunctionTools (local — bound per session):\n• extract_property_filters  →  returns FilterState to UI\n• get_free_slots  →  Google Calendar freebusy query\n• create_viewing_event  →  Google Calendar insert\n\nMCPToolset (Streamable HTTP → Kibana):\n• platform.core.generate_esql\n• platform.core.execute_esql\n• platform.core.get_index_mapping\n• platform.core.search\n• platform.core.get_document",
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "autoResize": true,
      "groupIds": ["adk-group"]
    },
